On Mon, Jul 13, 2015 at 05:48:41PM -0700, Grant Ridder wrote:
> Anyone else get an email like this?

Of course.  Everyone subscribed with their Gmail addresses gets these
whenever a Googler posts from their @google.com address.

> Is the list misconfigured due to Yahoo's DMARC change a bit ago?

Yes, but not just Yahoo's.  The @google.com vs. Gmail aspect of it has
been around for at least a year.

There appears to be no fix that is both easy and good.  But I agree I
need to look into it for real at some point.

